            "review_text": "macarilla\nDenver, Colorado13 contributions\n0\nDon’t waste your time\nOct 2018 • Couples\nWent there early evening hoping to have a small dinner. We ordered the traditional spring rolls which came out greasy and lackluster. I ordered this pho hubby order a beef dish. You would think in Ho Chi Minh City to PHO would be out of this world. Unfortunately the broth taste it almost like tapwater and it was lukewarm. The husbands beef was a little bit better but nothing too out of the ordinary. We walked away very disappointing that we had wasted one of our meals and Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nWritten October 24, 2018",
