            "review_title": "Review at 123 Vietnamese Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "907pamc\nSingapore, Singapore310 contributions\n0\nDecent food\nJul 2017\nWe tried this place only because we had free coffee and desert coupon.\n\nBut we instead had our lunch here and take the free coffee/desert afterwards.\n\nRestaurant is located at the 2nd floor- there are few diners as well.\n\nWe ordered the usual viet appetizers- spring rolls, fresh rolls (a bit tough), prawn lemongrass (good). The mains - chicken tamarind sauce(didn't taste the real tamarind), fish (this is yummy!), chix cashew (good also).\n\nDeserts are just fine...coffee is ok.\n\nOverall, u will never go wrong with this place. U will surely liked one or 2 dishes.\nRead more\nWritten July 16, 2017",
